.task-board/.resources/STORY-260720-3plyvy/STORY-260720-3plyvy_spawn-log_-analyst--solution-architect--codex-.log:5874:| Go dynamic-import directive | [Go compiler source](https://github.com/golang/go/blob/go1.25.5/src/cmd/compile/internal/noder/noder.go#L311-L332), [Go linker source](https://github.com/golang/go/blob/go1.25.5/src/cmd/link/internal/ld/go.go#L105-L136) | The compiler permits `go:cgo_import_dynamic` in ordinary non-standard source; `_ _ "library"` makes the internal linker add a selected dynamic library. It is not represented by go-list native file arrays, so active `GoFiles` need a separate rejection scan. |
